### Current user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Update display name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "displayName": "REST Client User"
}

### Active sessions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Revoke an owned session
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me/sessions/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Common error: no bearer token
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
### Admin: change user plan
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/users/{{userId}}/plan
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "plan": "PRO"
}

